of capital you have that's your leverage.

00:12:14.709 --> 00:12:18.320
In my opinion, this [social] is by far the
most important one.

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:20.020
Social capital to me is priceless.

00:12:20.020 --> 00:12:27.670
A company with social capital is so valuable,
so valuable, words can't even describe how

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:29.920
important social capital is.

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:32.070
Apple didn't have financial capital.

00:12:32.070 --> 00:12:34.540
Apple had social capital.

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:36.690
Facebook had social capital.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:37.970
These guys had social capital.

00:12:37.970 --> 00:12:42.800
There was a high level of belief that what
we're doing is going to impact the world in

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:44.140
a positive way.

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:45.390
Social capital.

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:50.350
So now, whether you're the person with the
money, or whether you're the person without

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:52.959
the money, now you have a formula to use.

